@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
actor User
participant "Codex / Claude" as Host
participant "Scenario specialist" as Skill
participant "Persistent tools" as Tools

User -> Host: Describe the outcome
Host -> Skill: Route by scenario
Skill -> Tools: Run deterministic helpers
Tools --> Skill: Artifact + validation evidence
Skill --> Host: Verified result
Host --> User: Deliver and explain
@enduml
